<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-020-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.147255" lon="-120.826946"><name>SC26-020-B</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 10.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 72/100; not catch probability. Center 157 ft; nearby 153–186 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-003</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.15037500375375" lon="-120.82746683036906"/><trkpt lat="35.15010468224927" lon="-120.82747401872578"/><trkpt lat="35.15029670283543" lon="-120.82812748075706"/><trkpt lat="35.149777694647675" lon="-120.82934864546066"/><trkpt lat="35.14862595677101" lon="-120.83047683616421"/><trkpt lat="35.14808924264032" lon="-120.83071060452261"/><trkpt lat="35.14601284235946" lon="-120.83054621888836"/><trkpt lat="35.14537226434073" lon="-120.8300144519542"/><trkpt lat="35.145356537457836" lon="-120.82913683146593"/><trkpt lat="35.14616553709708" lon="-120.82900558279425"/><trkpt lat="35.14596565346985" lon="-120.82791333790415"/><trkpt lat="35.14632608249121" lon="-120.82790375681273"/><trkpt lat="35.14632017978307" lon="-120.82757464567116"/><trkpt lat="35.14658656580058" lon="-120.82734805055526"/><trkpt lat="35.14656294342117" lon="-120.8260316028546"/><trkpt lat="35.147013479086525" lon="-120.8260196158281"/><trkpt lat